    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "BROE auctioneers are delighted to present this excellent three-bedroom extended family home, ideally positioned in a quiet cul-de-sac location within the popular Saint John’s Wood West development in Clondalkin, Dublin 22. The property enjoys a particularly attractive position overlooking a large green area to the front, offering a pleasant outlook and a safe, family-friendly setting. The accommodation has been extended to the rear, providing additional living space and making this an ideal home for growing families or buyers seeking a property with excellent potential. Upon entering, the welcoming accommodation comprises a porch, entrance hall, a bright lounge area, to the rear of the property is a modern kitchen, cum dining room, that opens onto the extension leading to a bright and spacious living area, with the extended rear accommodation providing valuable additional space for modern family living. Upstairs there are three bedrooms and a family bathroom. To the rear there is a west-facing garden that has a shed that is also wired for electricity, an excellent feature providing plenty of afternoon and evening sunshine. The property further benefits from gas-fired central heating, an alarm system and the significant advantage of being offered for sale with no onward chain, allowing for a smoother and potentially quicker purchase. Saint John’s Wood West is a well-established and highly regarded residential development, ideally located close to a wide range of local amenities. Clondalkin Village, schools, shops, parks, leisure facilities and public transport links are all within easy reach, while the M50 motorway provides excellent access to Dublin City Centre and surrounding areas. Early viewing is highly recommended. \r\n\r\nContact Shauna O’Brien of BROE auctioneers to register your interest."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Porch \t\t\t     1.39m x 1.66m \t\t\r\n\r\n\r\nEntrance Hall                  3.39m x 1.71m \t\tBright and spacious hallway to include an alarm panel. \r\n\t\t\t\t\t\r\n\r\nSitting Room                   4.43m x 3.70m \t\tThe spacious sitting room beautifully blends comfort and \r\nstyle. It features wood flooring and an electric fireplace, which adds a cosy touch. The large window lets in an abundant of natural light, making this area perfect for entertaining or spending quality time with family. \t\t\t\r\n\r\nKitchen\t\t      4.32m x 2.65m \t\tThe bright and spacious kitchen features modern floor-to-\r\nceiling units, complete with all appliances and tiled flooring throughout.\r\n\r\n\r\nDining Room\t\t      3.65m x 2.73m  \t\tTo include wood flooring. \r\n\r\n\r\nLounge\t\t      3.09m x 2.55m \t\tExtended to the rear to allow a bright and spacious area. \r\nDouble doors to garden. \r\n\r\n(1) Bedroom\t\t      3.45m x 3.50m \t\tTo include carpet flooring and built in wardrobes. \r\n\r\n\r\n(2) Bedroom\t\t      3.18m x 3.89m \t\tBright and spacious bedroom to include built in wardrobes, \r\nand carpet flooring. \r\n\r\n(3) Bedroom\t\t      2.64m x 2.35m \t\tBright and spacious bedroom to include built in wardrobes, \r\nand carpet flooring. \r\n\r\nBathroom                         2.02m x 1.97m\t\tFully tiled bathroom featuring a W.C., WHB, Vanity unit, \r\nshower unit with a Triton T90sr shower.   \r\n\r\nGarden \t\t       \t\t\t\tThe property boasts a stunning, low-maintenance garden \r\nperfect for enjoying the sunshine. To include block shed. \r\n\r\n\r\nPlease note we have not tested any appliances , fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only.\r\n\r\n\r\nPlease note any information, statement, description, quantity or measurement so given or contained in any such sales particulars, webpage, brochure, catalogue, email, letter, written valuations or hand out issued by or on behalf of BROE auctioneers are for illustration purposes only and are not to be taken as matters of fact. Any mistake, omission, inaccuracy or mis description given orally or contained in any sales particulars, webpage, brochure, catalogue, email, letter, written valuation or hand out issues by BROE auctioneers. Agents shall not give rise to any right of action, claim, entitlement or compensation against BROE auctioneers. Intending purchasers must satisfy themselves by carrying out their own independent due diligence, inspections or otherwise as to the correctness of any and all the information, statements, descriptions, quantity or measurements contained in any such sales particulars, webpage, brochure, catalogue, email, letter, written valuation or hand out issued by BROE auctioneers. The services, systems and appliances shown have not been tested and no warranty is made or given by BROE auctioneers as to their operability or efficiency."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "•\tGas heating.\r\n•\tBER C.\r\n•\tc.96 mtrs sq.\r\n•\tAlarmed.\r\n•\tDouble glazed windows.\r\n•\tNo on ward chain. \r\n•\tLow maintenance west facing garden.  \r\n•\tQuiet cul-de-sac location\r\n•\tOverlooking a green area to the front.\r\n•\tExcellent location. \r\n•\tEarly viewing highly recommended."
      },
